# DigidLocal

# Fork of 0.25.1 that restores the `replaces` list on the squashed
# 0001_initial_to_v019 migration (dropped upstream in 0.25.x). Without it, installs
# that ran the old individual 0001..0016 migrations re-run the squash's CreateModel on
# upgrade -> DuplicateTable. Once every install has upgraded through a release
# containing this pin, switch back to a stock PyPI version (>=0.25.2).
django-digid-eherkenning[oidc] @ git+https://github.com/maykinmedia/django-digid-eherkenning@090e315
mozilla-django-oidc-db[setup-configuration]
